.TH __NAME__ 1 __NAME__\-VERSION
.SH NAME
__NAME__ \- copy files to standard output
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B __NAME__
.RB [ \-v ]
.RI [ file ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B __NAME__
writes each
.I file
in order to standard output.
With no
.IR file ,
or when
.I file
is
.BR \- ,
it reads standard input.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-v
print version information to standard output, then exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
0
Success.
.TP
1
A usage error or an unreadable file.
